        "- **No environment available:** Architecture cannot be validated against a real environment until one is configured. (Grounded in: risk/output.md TR-1, project.yaml environments.)",
        "- **No application under test:** Architecture assumptions about the application structure cannot be verified until application source code or a running application is available. (Grounded in: risk/output.md TR-2.)",
        "- **Integration point unknown:** The architecture must accommodate both UI and API test paths until the feature integration point is confirmed. (Grounded in: risk/output.md BR-1.)",
        "",
        "## 10. Implementation Plan",
        "",
        "1. Confirm feature integration point (UI vs API vs both) — blocked pending human clarification (BR-1).",
        "2. Enable a test environment in the project adapter — blocked pending project configuration (TR-1).",
